# The operator tools beyond busybox, upstream roots of the Base lock: the GNU command set and bash for scripts
# and operators that rely on them, the process tools, module loading, the device-mapper tools and the nftables
# command. The floor answers each of these names with busybox where busybox has the applet; udev loads modules
# through libkmod and the kernel assembles the verity root without them, and mica-podman pulls nftables in by
# its own dependency. A product for small flash leaves the feature out.
coreutils
findutils
grep
sed
diffutils
gzip
bash
procps
kmod
dmsetup
nftables
